  "title": "Test fire: fill system and motor on the stand",
  "description": "The station in test-fire mode. The fill plumbing from the bottles through the actuator-board solenoids and the quick disconnect into the run tank, the valve-board vent, dump and main valves, and the motor on the test stand: the KG50 carries the hanging vehicle, the KG1000 takes the thrust once the gap closes, and the chamber PT reads the burn. No AV bay. Flow is drawn only when every valve on a path is confirmed open and the upstream pressure exceeds the downstream pressure.",
